            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-f7654adc7345-0001-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 27,
              "start": 27
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The parties dispute the scope of the probate exception, with the petitioner arguing the exception should not bar the bankruptcy court\u2019s jurisdiction, and the respondent asserting the exception prevents federal courts from interfering with probate matters."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "United States (amicus curiae)",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "f7654adc7345c2cc6912d9ccd1a0bb876231e41fa8eee51a362ee855d7fc4323",
            "evidence_ids": [
