              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 27,
                "start": 27
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Respondent, the probate exception exists to prevent a Federal court from enjoining ongoing probate proceedings, invalidating the estate plan, reallocating assets, or creating a novel cause of action."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Respondent",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "f7654adc7345c2cc6912d9ccd1a0bb876231e41fa8eee51a362ee855d7fc4323",
              "evidence_ids": [
